prefs-citation-dialog-initial-collection-mode-help = When "Main library" is selected, all items in that library will be displayed; when "Match client selection" is selected, the dialog will select the library or collection currently selected in the Zotero client and fall back to the main library if it cannot be restored; when "Last selected collection" is selected, the library or collection last selected in the citation dialog will be restored.
