prefs-word-addon-title = Word Template
prefs-word-addon-help = Install the Banyan Word template (Banyan.dotm) into Word's STARTUP folder so Word loads it as a global add-in on startup. Close Microsoft Word first, then install; restart Word afterwards and enable macros/content when prompted.
